    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 44af57e4c14f5783051909001f24a9b762292cf4 -->\n**Review (M3, local PR-reviewer, delta over #1166, head-only, posted under PROCESS_VERSION 32): no code blockers, but the PR conflicts with main.**\n\n**Parent:** this PR stacks on #1166, not #1157, so it merges after #1166.\n\n**Conflicts:** the #1131 resolutions apply, plus `create.rs` and `edit.rs`. Its own `SinkerSideBurn` tag (42) moves to 43 after the renumbers.\n\n**What holds:**\n- Allowance = undersize - gap; a move past it is refused by name, as are a gap greater than the undersize, a zero or non-finite amount, and an orbit.\n- `sinker_gate` runs on create, paste, edit and change-kind.\n- The stamp digests the side gap.\n- The sim convicts an overstated undersize.\n\n**Tests at the head:**\n- motion 204, app lib 148.\n- app: `sinker_side` 5, `sinker_orbit` 6, `golden_cl` 25, `operations` 117, plus others.\n- Clippy: clean.\n",
