    "body": "Merge-time refresh (maintainer session): merged origin/main into the branch, head now 0a094208 (the PR was a draft; no hand-edit round-trip needed).\n\nHand-resolved hunks (both sides kept; the wire contour from #1131 and the side burn from this PR now sit side by side): kinds.rs (WireContour 41, SinkerBurn 42, SinkerSideBurn 43, digest tag 43, 44 kinds, ALL_LABELS length), types/params.rs, types/mod.rs (re-exports), generate.rs, create.rs/edit.rs (sinker_gate kept next to tool_door and wire_gate), posting.rs and setup_sheet/heights.rs (side burn arm beside the wire arm), stamp.rs (side-gap term kept; the tool terms now live in main's stamp_tool.rs), plus the kind-count pins in operation/tests.rs, ribbon.rs, coarse_laws.rs (SinkerSideBurn stays refused) and lathe_voice_tests.rs (refused 30 -> 31).\n\nTests: camcraft-app --lib 154 passed; sinker_burn, sinker_burn_held, sinker_orbit, sinker_side, ribbon, coarse_laws, tool_law, wire_contour, mcp_wire_contour all green; camcraft-ui --lib 635 passed (5 ignored); clippy -D warnings on camcraft-app and camcraft-ui clean.\n\nA delta review follows.\n",
