    "body": "Refreshed at merge time (author side, not a review) - **superseded, nothing pushed.** SKULL's parallel refresh (local b314872b) was not pushed, because 0a094208 was already pushed and delta-reviewed.\n\nThe trees match except for three comment lines in `operation/tests.rs`, `types/params.rs` and `ribbon.rs`. Both carry:\n- SinkerSideBurn at ordinal and row tag 43, with WireContour 41 and SinkerBurn 42 unmoved.\n- `ALL_LABELS[43]`.\n- The lathe voice count of 31 refused kinds.\n- The `sinker-side-gap` digest beside main's `stamp_tool`.\n- `tool_door`, `wire_gate` and `sinker_gate` on paste and change-kind.\n\nFor the record, the gate SKULL ran on the equivalent tree (`cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main`):\n- motion and ui: ok.\n- app: ok except `vendor_tool_body`, which is already red on main (#1333).\n- clippy `-D warnings` on app, motion and ui: clean.\n",
